### Attribution Notice & Original Work Credits

This project (**Secret Bug**) is an independent, non-commercial software re-skin of the social deduction board game **Secret Hitler**, originally designed by Goat, Wolf, & Cabbage LLC (Max Temkin, Mike Boxleiter, Tommy Maranges, and Mac Wingbrot).

*Secret Bug* is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Goat, Wolf, & Cabbage LLC.

